# Container-build context exclusions. Keep this list DISJOINT from the
# [tool.hatch.build.targets.wheel.force-include] enumeration in
# pyproject.toml: force-include requires every listed file to exist in
# the context, so excluding one breaks the image build with
# "Forced include not found" (found the hard way on the v5.5.0 image,
# card vesma-ghcr-5x-parity, 2026-10-05 — scripts/local-release.sh was
# excluded here while being force-included there).
#
# scripts/run-release-local.sh — untracked machine-local symlink
#   (#481); excluding it is safe, it ships in no wheel.
# scripts/local-ci/run-all.sh — sdist-excluded, ships in no wheel
#   (pyproject.toml force-include comment), safe to exclude.
scripts/run-release-local.sh
scripts/local-ci/run-all.sh
